#: contributing/bisecting_regressions.rst:95
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"After entering one of the commands above, Git will switch to a different "
"commit. You should now build Rebel Engine again, try to reproduce the bug, "
"then enter ``git bisect good`` or ``git bisect bad`` depending on the "
"result. You'll have to repeat this several times. The longer the commit "
"range, the more steps will be required. 5 to 10 steps are usually sufficient "
"to find most regressions; Git will remind you of the number of steps "
"remaining (in the worst case scenario)."
