#: contributing/bug_triage_guidelines.rst:2
msgid "Bug triage guidelines"
msgstr "Directrices para el triaje de errores"

#: contributing/bug_triage_guidelines.rst:4
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This page describes the typical workflow of the bug triage team aka bugsquad "
"when handling issues and pull requests on Rebel Engine's `GitHub repository "
"<https://github.com/RebelToolbox/RebelEngine>`__. It is bound to evolve "
"together with the bugsquad, so do not hesitate to propose modifications to "
