#: contributing/pr_workflow.rst:56
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The stable branches are named after their version, e.g. ``1.0`` and ``1.1``. "
"They are used to backport bugfixes and enhancements from the ``main`` branch "
"to the currently maintained stable release (e.g. 1.1.1). As a rule of thumb, "
