#: getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:145
msgid "With that, we're ready to code the spawn mechanism."
msgstr "Ahora, estamos listos para programar el mecanismo de generación."

#: getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:148
msgid "Spawning monsters randomly"
msgstr "Agregando monstruos aleatoriamente"

#: getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:150
msgid "Right-click on the *Main* node and attach a new script to it."
msgstr "Haz clic derecho sobre el nodo *Main* y adjúntale un nuevo script."

#: getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:152
msgid ""
"We first export a variable to the *Inspector* so that we can assign ``Mob."
"tscn`` or any other monster to it."
msgstr ""
"Primero exportamos una variable al *Inspector* para que podamos asignarle "
"``Mob.tscn`` o cualquier otro monstruo."

#: getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:155
msgid ""
