msgstr "Agrega un nodo *Label* y renómbralo como *ScoreLabel*."

#: getting_started/first_3d_game/08.score_and_replay.rst:18
msgid ""
"In the *Inspector*, set the *Label*'s *Text* to a placeholder like \"Score: "
