#: getting_started/first_3d_game/08.score_and_replay.rst:44
msgid "Creating a UI theme"
msgstr "Creando un tema de interfaz de usuario"

#: getting_started/first_3d_game/08.score_and_replay.rst:46
msgid ""
"Once again, select the *UserInterface* node. In the *Inspector*, create a "
"new theme resource in *Theme -> Theme*."
msgstr ""
"Una vez más, selecciona el nodo *UserInterface*. En el *Inspector*, crea un "
