#: tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:139
msgid "Now we add the shadow casters."
msgstr "Ahora crearemos los generadores de sombra."

#: tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:141
msgid ""
"The demo uses a :ref:`Node <class_Node2D>` named \"casters\" to organize the "
"shadow casters. Add a :ref:`Node2D <class_Node2D>` to the scene. It will be "
"used to group all the shadow casters together. This way we can show and hide "
"them all at the same time."
msgstr ""
"La demo usa un :ref:`Node <class_Node2D>` llamado \"casters\" para organizar "
"los nodos que proyectarán sombras. Entonces agrega un :ref:`Node "
