msgstr "Consejos y trucos"

#: tutorials/2d/using_tilemaps.rst:341
msgid ""
"If you're using a :ref:`Camera2D <class_Camera2D>` to scroll your level, you "
"may notice lines appearing between your tiles. To fix this, open Project "
"Settings and enable **Use Gpu Pixel Snap** in the **Rendering > 2d > "
"Snapping** section."
msgstr ""
"Si estás usando una :ref:`Camera2D <class_Camera2D>` para desplazar el "
"nivel, tal vez notes unas líneas que aparecen entre tus tiles. Para arreglar "
"esto, abre Ajustes de Proyecto y activa \"Use Pixel Snap\" en la sección "
"\"Rendering/Quality\"."

#: tutorials/2d/using_tilemaps.rst:345
