#: tutorials/3d/portals/rooms_and_portals_example.rst:34
msgid "Rotate and position the second room so that the openings line up."
msgstr ""
"Rota y posiciona la segunda sala de manera que las aperturas se alineen."

#: tutorials/3d/portals/rooms_and_portals_example.rst:35
msgid "Rename the second room to ``Lounge``."
msgstr "Renombra la segunda sala como \"Sala de estar\"."

#: tutorials/3d/portals/rooms_and_portals_example.rst:38
msgid "Step 3"
msgstr "Paso 3"

#: tutorials/3d/portals/rooms_and_portals_example.rst:42
msgid "Next, we will add a portal between the two rooms."
msgstr "A continuación, agregaremos un portal entre las dos salas."

#: tutorials/3d/portals/rooms_and_portals_example.rst:43
msgid "Create a new :ref:`Portal<class_Portal>` in the kitchen."
msgstr "Crea un nuevo nodo :ref:`Portal<class_Portal>` en la cocina."

#: tutorials/3d/portals/rooms_and_portals_example.rst:44
msgid ""
"Scale and position the portal using the node ``Transform`` in the inspector, "
"so it fits within the opening between the two rooms."
msgstr ""
"Escala y posiciona el portal utilizando el nodo ``Transform`` en el "
