"estén en la rama de \"RoomList\", el sistema intentará colocarlos "
"automáticamente en la sala correcta durante la ejecución."

#: tutorials/3d/portals/rooms_and_portals_example.rst:54
msgid ""
"On the screenshot, the boxes were places as children of a Spatial I have "
"called ``Freeform`` to keep things tidy."
msgstr ""
"En la captura de pantalla, las cajas se colocaron como hijos de un nodo "
"Spatial que has llamado ``Freeform`` para mantener las cosas ordenadas."

#: tutorials/3d/portals/rooms_and_portals_example.rst:55
msgid ""
"Boxes also have a green SpatialMaterial assigned to them to make them stand "
