#: tutorials/3d/portals/rooms_and_portals_example.rst:68
msgid "Step 6"
msgstr "Paso 6"

#: tutorials/3d/portals/rooms_and_portals_example.rst:72
msgid ""
"Make sure you have saved your project before this next step. It is always a "
