"You may find videos with an ``.ogg`` or ``.ogx`` extensions, which are "
"generic extensions for data within an Ogg container."
msgstr ""
"Puedes encontrar videos con extensiones ``.ogg`` o ``.ogx``, que son "
"extensiones genéricas para datos dentro de un contenedor Ogg."

#: tutorials/animation/playing_videos.rst:25
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Renaming these file extensions to ``.ogv`` *may* allow the videos to be "
"imported. However, not all files with ``.ogg`` or ``.ogx`` extensions are "
"videos - some of them may only contain audio."
msgstr ""
