#: tutorials/performance/threads/using_multiple_threads.rst:57
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Accessing objects or data from multiple threads is not always supported (if "
"you do it, it will cause unexpected behaviors or crashes). Read the :doc:"
"`thread_safe_apis` documentation to understand which engine APIs support "
