#: tutorials/physics/collision_shapes_3d.rst:26
#, fuzzy
msgid "Rebel Engine provides the following primitive collision shape types:"
msgstr ""
"Godot proporciona los siguientes tipos de formas de colisión primitivas:"

#: tutorials/physics/collision_shapes_3d.rst:28
