#: tutorials/physics/using_kinematic_body_2d.rst:148
msgid ""
"`get_slide_count()` only counts times the body has collided and changed "
"direction."
msgstr ""
"`get_slide_count()` sólo cuenta las veces que el cuerpo ha chocado y "
