"ref:`Node.remove_child() <class_Node_method_remove_child>` o cuando liberas "
"un nodo."

#: tutorials/scripting/overridable_functions.rst:69
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The two virtual methods ``_process()`` and ``_physics_process()`` allow you "
