#: tutorials/shaders/advanced_postprocessing.rst:19
msgid "Full screen quad"
msgstr "Quad de pantalla completa"

#: tutorials/shaders/advanced_postprocessing.rst:21
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the :doc:`custom post-processing tutorial </tutorials/shaders/"
"custom_postprocessing>`, we covered how to use a Viewport to make custom "
