#: tutorials/vr/openvr/vr_starter_tutorial_part_one.rst:88
msgid ""
"If the VR system supports room tracking, then the :ref:`ARVRCamera "
"<class_ARVRCamera>` node may be offset on the X and Z axes as the player "
