"``visible`` a ``true``."

#: tutorials/vr/openvr/vr_starter_tutorial_part_two.rst:346
#, fuzzy
msgid "Pistol dropped function"
msgstr "Funciones de procesamiento"

#: tutorials/vr/openvr/vr_starter_tutorial_part_two.rst:348
msgid ""
"This function simply makes the ``laser_sight_mesh`` :ref:`MeshInstance "
"<class_MeshInstance>` invisible by setting the ``visible`` property to "
"``false``."
msgstr ""
"Esta función simplemente hace que la ``laser_sight_mesh`` :ref:`MeshInstance "
